  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos State Employment Trust Fund (LSETF)- Leapworld Service Support Training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Leapworld Limited is a multi-sectorial competency development, consulting, empowerment, capacity building, human resource development, training, and business management group. The objective of the project is to train one hundred and fifty (150) youths aged 18-35 years particularly for that resident in Lagos State, on relevant business management skills required in the general workspace.</narrative>
